WEBVTT

00:02:27.226 --> 00:02:32.190
a kind of a blindness to the realities
of the world's problems

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:35.151
or some kind of Pollyanna self-delusion.

00:02:37.028 --> 00:02:42.658
Instead, optimism is based
on the fact of historical progress,

00:02:42.658 --> 00:02:45.828
that if we transcend anecdote

00:02:45.828 --> 00:02:50.333
and look at data
in a scientific, rational way,

00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:52.501
that we can see that the evidence says

00:02:52.501 --> 00:02:54.170
that on average,

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.923
on a global scale over time,

00:02:56.923 --> 00:02:58.758
over the last 500 years,

00:02:58.758 --> 00:03:02.220
there has been incremental
improvement over time.